      "en": "He called to himself his twelve disciples, and gave them authority over unclean spirits, to cast them out, and to heal every disease and every sickness.",
      "ko": "예수께서 그 열 두 제자를 부르사 더러운 귀신을 쫓아내며 모든 병과 모든 약한 것을 고치는 권능을 주시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "4e8d4098b28380e63edf8bd4c9a64fe6c73d8587d1f266ed04659e60e0768506",
      "translation_text_hash": "27a70f2e4396a7ea578c6e17d7e4a160c9c00d48162ad8da2d17fd6d5e8feadc",
