      ],
      "en": "Rather, go to the lost sheep of the house of Israel.",
      "ko": "차라리 이스라엘 집의 잃어버린 양에게로 가라",
      "source_text_hash": "20204debe3c87f3489060fd3a819816ed18184abdfe6267a553b12fa33014bbb",
      "translation_text_hash": "b43cbfc9653a45e79df68d67e1621578a05688fc5eefa043e94bfc3d9eed96cc",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
