      "en": "“Brother will deliver up brother to death, and the father his child. Children will rise up against parents and cause them to be put to death.",
      "ko": "장차 형제가 형제를, 아비가 자식을 죽는데 내어주며 자식들이 부모를 대적하여 죽게 하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "ca272e70d2acbb00872aea2c6dcd18c95a4c018df6027605308640427aa11db0",
      "translation_text_hash": "3d771a993602918e91b85c7b3b78be5342e391444a9e795262f2f83d20681d74",
